    skos:definition "Metadata every governed Markdown document declares, so a retriever can carry a passage's authority and audience along with its text. An ungoverned RAG loses both at chunk time: explanatory prose comes back looking like a rule, and a Realm-private paragraph comes back to whoever asked. Those are the documentary forms of privilege escalation, and this schema is where they are refused (ADR-0014)." ;
